{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.061728394826253238,"t":"Test 6","y":0.071220930075987732,"x":0.10905349795724377,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.1380284118652344,"t":"READING","h":0.019518082779344081,"y":0.11306072589635796,"x":0.4567059583149351,"c":1},{"x":0.10892237580640937,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","y":0.1772535715707847,"w":0.30890197753906246,"h":0.017359107908287097,"c":1},{"y":0.21366279053664006,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","x":0.11111111392059513,"w":0.81481480916341142,"h":0.017491508569256853,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.23141110455840408,"h":0.01964575494557308,"w":0.17134160359700523,"x":0.10875087442278471,"t":"Passage 1 below."},{"w":0.70184244791666661,"h":0.023014437043062941,"x":0.17685598979379136,"t":"The risks agriculture faces in developing countries","y":0.26965075057870846,"c":1},{"t":"D","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.67441860439942358,"c":1,"x":0.11316872451302065,"w":0.018518517812093099},{"h":0.020736667376946127,"c":1,"y":0.30946366686302673,"w":0.34208892822265624,"t":"Synthesis of an online debate*","x":0.35778949598882925},{"t":"Two things distinguish food production from all other productive activities: first,","x":0.1460321118946743,"w":0.74907430013020848,"y":0.33989521040073511,"h":0.019574500085046687,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018758240240342006,"t":"every single person needs food each day and has a right to it; and second, it is","y":0.35792520973286335,"x":0.15631948419343739,"w":0.74498392740885411},{"x":0.15637859686885217,"h":0.017667844522968323,"y":0.37632508814805554,"t":"hugely dependent on nature. These two unique aspects, one political, the other","w":0.74897120157877606,"c":1},{"t":"natural, make food production highly vulnerable and different from any other","h":0.019596421114828289,"w":0.72030960083007822,"c":1,"x":0.15631255652167161,"y":0.39338358282964037},{"t":"business. At the same time, cultural values are highly entrenched in food and","h":0.020871120852772651,"w":0.72863576253255213,"c":1,"x":0.15627670509601482,"y":0.41070998720347851},{"w":0.30075299580891923,"t":"agricultural systems worldwide.","h":0.018965126909271657,"x":0.15618951784039145,"c":1,"y":0.42987483166541751},{"w":0.71604939778645837,"t":"Farmers everywhere face major risks, including extreme weather, long-term","y":0.45784883759630313,"h":0.018895348053517669,"x":0.15637859324668851,"c":1},{"w":0.70383015950520833,"h":0.020288775189043706,"c":1,"x":0.15836368107867865,"t":"climate change, and price volatility in input and product markets. However,","y":0.47430004423031447},{"y":0.49263839808478838,"t":"smallholder farmers in developing countries must in addition deal with adverse","x":0.15843621991502801,"w":0.73868311564127609,"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1},{"x":0.15836429932940149,"t":"environments, both natural, in terms of soil quality, rainfall, etc., and human, in","h":0.020458142805155566,"w":0.7367766825358073,"c":1,"y":0.51012236084202067},{"h":0.017455556507807057,"c":1,"t":"terms of infrastructure, financial systems, markets, knowledge and technology.","y":0.52906976728137922,"w":0.74074076334635419,"x":0.15637858945665564},{"c":1,"t":"Counter-intuitively, hunger is prevalent among many smallholder farmers in the","x":0.158381911206219,"w":0.74498428344726564,"h":0.019273654591770439,"y":0.54599061426171458},{"w":0.17078189849853517,"t":"developing worid.","x":0.15843621113633446,"h":0.016005492463128657,"c":1,"y":0.56684334487946841},{"w":0.80467315673828121,"h":0.019276593121819618,"c":1,"y":0.590866115654611,"x":0.1439704118885542,"t":"Participants in the online debate argued that our biggest challenge is to address the"},{"x":0.15834280733423572,"y":0.60771974368681747,"c":1,"h":0.020539473588671586,"t":"underlying causes of the agricultural system's inability to ensure sufficient food for","w":0.77591064453125003},{"w":0.79031768798828139,"c":1,"h":0.02031547806990297,"y":0.62603246059968742,"t":"all, and they identified as drivers of this problem our dependency on fossil fuels and","x":0.15834142402707765},{"x":0.16049382385404395,"y":0.64680232540296123,"w":0.32921811421712244,"t":"unsupportive government policies.","c":1,"h":0.016036308275094724},{"w":0.73456792195638021,"t":"On the question of mitigating the risks farmers face, most essayists called for","x":0.15432097729402358,"y":0.67285041234903742,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"w":0.71208902994791667,"x":0.16040635841524495,"t":"greater state intervention. In his essay, Kanayo F. Nwanze, President of the","c":1,"y":0.68951091702379885,"h":0.019818709230816189},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"t":"International Fund for Agricultural Development, argued that governments can","x":0.15843621988008333,"y":0.70930232542112637,"w":0.73868311564127609},{"c":1,"x":0.16042570957274735,"w":0.76145894368489575,"t":"significantly reduce risks for farmers by providing basic services like roads to get","y":0.72482846313787463,"h":0.019614888023852806},{"y":0.74269347422071674,"t":"produce more efficiently to markets, or water and food storage facilities to reduce","x":0.16034764067187987,"h":0.020564624080950056,"c":1,"w":0.76569803873697917},{"c":1,"x":0.1583598078987408,"w":0.74296071370442707,"t":"losses. Sophia Murphy, senior advisor to the Institute for Agriculture and Trade","h":0.020086081766548691,"y":0.76110886455367688},{"t":"Policy, suggested that the procurement and holding of stocks by governments","w":0.73267247517903655,"x":0.16247070574530614,"y":0.7788697437457951,"h":0.019413086494652565,"c":1},{"h":0.020828215618156065,"c":1,"x":0.16038953713545689,"y":0.79521318772506622,"t":"can also help mitigate wild swings in food prices by alleviating uncertainties about","w":0.77386637369791667},{"c":1,"t":"market supply.","x":0.16255144220395296,"w":0.13991769154866535,"y":0.81831395332768631,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"y":0.91712997454154488,"h":0.020365738615972795,"t":"*The personal names in the text refer to the authors of written contributions to the online debate.","x":0.11514874446153404,"w":0.75116007486979175},{"w":0.026748971939086916,"c":1,"y":0.94331395373771632,"h":0.014534882858869502,"t":"36","x":0.11522633710144421},{"t":"leltsresources.org","c":1,"x":0.39483721539984068,"y":0.96768258547277797,"h":0.01645441358586508,"w":0.20827172597249349}],"h":3395}